{"id":5355,"date":"2025-08-31T08:57:05","date_gmt":"2025-08-31T01:57:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5355"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:17:54","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:17:54","slug":"amazon-la-gi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-amazon\/amazon-la-gi\/","title":{"rendered":"Amazon l\u00e0 g\u00ec? H\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh, l\u1ee3i \u00edch v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch mua h\u00e0ng Amazon"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"Ij9Ldbgyyo78IKxo9YrljDzbgeI\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XxfHd2nI5ohXeTxDLQllMGAvgsc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1i t\u00ean v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng quen thu\u1ed9c tr\u00ean to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u, nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i ai c\u0169ng hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 v\u1ec1 quy m\u00f4, l\u1ecbch s\u1eed v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a &#8220;g\u00e3 kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3&#8221; n\u00e0y. \u0110\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trang web mua s\u1eafm, m\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng t\u1eadp \u0111o\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi. B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft sau \u0111\u00e2y c\u1ee7a <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> s\u1ebd cung c\u1ea5p cho b\u1ea1n m\u1ed9t c\u00e1i nh\u00ecn t\u1ed5ng quan v\u1ec1 Amazon, t\u1eeb h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ea7y \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng cho \u0111\u1ebfn h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1ch mua s\u1eafm tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-KLxydBNJhouoJjxtA36lMlR3gah\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon l\u00e0 g\u00ec? H\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Vq9wdsWGoomk0nx4RuxlMjDHgQa\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;493b3862-9703-477a-9e05-c9c980931bc3&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FIlZDbjPhVoC2e7xpH7tlMEdgg7d%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;IlZDbjPhVoC2e7xpH7tlMEdgg7d&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:401210,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;493b3862-9703-477a-9e05-c9c980931bc3&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FIlZDbjPhVoC2e7xpH7tlMEdgg7d%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;IlZDbjPhVoC2e7xpH7tlMEdgg7d&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:401210,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5356\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5356\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5356\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/d0d76748-1766-42b2-86e9-2f49fafad184.png\" alt=\"Amazon l\u00e0 g\u00ec? H\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/d0d76748-1766-42b2-86e9-2f49fafad184.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/d0d76748-1766-42b2-86e9-2f49fafad184-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/d0d76748-1766-42b2-86e9-2f49fafad184-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/d0d76748-1766-42b2-86e9-2f49fafad184-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/d0d76748-1766-42b2-86e9-2f49fafad184-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5356\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Amazon l\u00e0 g\u00ec? H\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Ij9Ldbgyyo78IKxo9YrljDzbgeI\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TZjhdHE5to0ue8xveIElhRfHgcg\"><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/en.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Amazon_(company)\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Amazon<\/a><\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u1eadp \u0111o\u00e0n c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 \u0111a qu\u1ed1c gia c\u1ee7a M\u1ef9, c\u00f3 tr\u1ee5 s\u1edf t\u1ea1i Seattle, Washington. C\u00f4ng ty t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o c\u00e1c l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c ch\u00ednh bao g\u1ed3m th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, \u0111i\u1ec7n to\u00e1n \u0111\u00e1m m\u00e2y (Amazon Web Services &#8211; AWS), streaming k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 (Amazon Prime Video) v\u00e0 tr\u00ed tu\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n t\u1ea1o.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L6zMduR9NoBeRExeHWOliJCGgcc\">H\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a Amazon l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng \u0111\u00e1ng kinh ng\u1ea1c nh\u1ea5t trong l\u1ecbch s\u1eed kinh doanh hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BmlqdcMzDoQ4Npx6Lh6ludKsg7b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>1994:<\/strong> Jeff Bezos th\u00e0nh l\u1eadp Amazon v\u1edbi kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t hi\u1ec7u s\u00e1ch tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BpHfdL4IeoJXTTxDSlSlUFO4grg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nh\u1eefng n\u0103m 2000:<\/strong> C\u00f4ng ty nhanh ch\u00f3ng m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng sang nhi\u1ec1u ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng kh\u00e1c nhau nh\u01b0 \u0111\u1ed3 \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, qu\u1ea7n \u00e1o, \u0111\u1ed3 gia d\u1ee5ng, \u0111\u1ed3 ch\u01a1i&#8230; bi\u1ebfn m\u00ecnh th\u00e0nh &#8220;c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng b\u00e1ch h\u00f3a c\u1ee7a m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9&#8221;.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-La3idVwLMoFn09xmgf9lKJ1lgpb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i:<\/strong> Amazon \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t &#8220;g\u00e3 kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3&#8221; to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u, kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 th\u1ed1ng tr\u1ecb m\u1ea3ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed m\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u0111i \u0111\u1ea7u trong nhi\u1ec1u l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 kh\u00e1c v\u1edbi c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ed9t ph\u00e1 nh\u01b0 <strong>Amazon Prime<\/strong>, d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111i\u1ec7n to\u00e1n \u0111\u00e1m m\u00e2y <strong>AWS<\/strong>, v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb \u0111\u1ecdc s\u00e1ch <strong>Kindle<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OFd6d0ZbFoaBVXxYePYlhHIrgHg\">T\u1ea1i sao n\u00ean mua h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon?<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-WTeddey89odDOQxPwUqlEggygAf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b87d626a-4753-4742-8413-68f3292b6bc5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FQCJUb5tACodpAhxLfZelyfSQgic%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;QCJUb5tACodpAhxLfZelyfSQgic&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:397801,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b87d626a-4753-4742-8413-68f3292b6bc5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FQCJUb5tACodpAhxLfZelyfSQgic%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;QCJUb5tACodpAhxLfZelyfSQgic&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:397801,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5357\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5357\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5357\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/ee9a8963-3532-4f18-ab79-37495128752e.png\" alt=\"T\u1ea1i sao n\u00ean mua h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/ee9a8963-3532-4f18-ab79-37495128752e.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/ee9a8963-3532-4f18-ab79-37495128752e-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/ee9a8963-3532-4f18-ab79-37495128752e-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/ee9a8963-3532-4f18-ab79-37495128752e-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/ee9a8963-3532-4f18-ab79-37495128752e-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5357\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>T\u1ea1i sao n\u00ean mua h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Ij9Ldbgyyo78IKxo9YrljDzbgeI\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OefmdM2JYohmvzxBcNHle83lgDd\">S\u1ee9c h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn c\u1ee7a Amazon \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng l\u1ee3i \u00edch v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i m\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y mang l\u1ea1i cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LjuPdcTKVoNCaGxaHIGlafWigre\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 \u0111a d\u1ea1ng:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u1eeb h\u1ea7u h\u1ebft m\u1ecdi ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng, t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng m\u00f3n \u0111\u1ed3 th\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o, kh\u00f3 t\u00ecm \u1edf th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng n\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ecba.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZFaydPhW9o0XWCxY68Ilj60cgfb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 uy t\u00edn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o:<\/strong> Amazon c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch r\u1ea5t kh\u1eaft khe \u0111\u1ec3 ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n. C\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u00e1n v\u00e0 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n b\u1edfi ch\u00ednh Amazon (&#8220;Ships from and sold by Amazon.com&#8221;) lu\u00f4n c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 tin c\u1eady cao.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A11ddSwwfoq3DUxTWgJlhS1jgIg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3 c\u1ea1nh tranh:<\/strong> Nh\u1edd quy m\u00f4 kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3 v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 c\u1ea1nh tranh gi\u1eefa c\u00e1c ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n, b\u1ea1n th\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u1edbi m\u1ee9c gi\u00e1 t\u1ed1t. Amazon c\u0169ng th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean c\u00f3 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 Prime Day, Black Friday.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YVp5dhuuboLu5oxSLgele6lugUf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p:<\/strong> Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3, ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a Amazon r\u1ea5t linh ho\u1ea1t v\u00e0 lu\u00f4n \u01b0u ti\u00ean b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 quy\u1ec1n l\u1ee3i c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OdSjdVVlDoDtJdxaUOYlXFizgsg\">Vi\u1ec7c duy tr\u00ec m\u1ed9t ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n cao nh\u01b0 v\u1eady c\u0169ng \u0111\u1eb7t ra th\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c l\u1edbn cho c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p Vi\u1ec7t Nam mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u01b0a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh l\u00ean th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf n\u00e0y, vi\u1ec7c hi\u1ec3u v\u00e0 tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 c\u00e1c quy \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\u1eaft khe l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c. C\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p nh\u01b0 <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong> cung c\u1ea5p <strong>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 V\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Amazon<\/strong>, gi\u00fap c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng gian h\u00e0ng chu\u1ea9n, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng c\u00e1c ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n c\u1ee7a Amazon.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-VfIWdEmYpoC000xpBNmlrJvmg1d\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn mua h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon chi ti\u1ebft<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Oiw9dvjuOobhkdxV03blZLWyggb\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VQ40diKsUoqalsxUX9SlMpxNgcT\">\u0110\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon. Qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd kh\u00e1 \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1 nh\u01b0 c\u00e1c trang th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed kh\u00e1c. B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 email v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t th\u1ebb thanh to\u00e1n qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf (Visa, Mastercard&#8230;) \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 mua h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-KDNqdkCoIop9YRxUTJyl2G20g7e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;ba5097a6-670b-4748-9c61-6b5cb3ec477c&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FDRrjbT9BboAQyIxLpImlVdsFgub%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;DRrjbT9BboAQyIxLpImlVdsFgub&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:292271,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;ba5097a6-670b-4748-9c61-6b5c