1ebfm s\u1ea3n v\u00e0 xem x\u00e9t k\u1ef9 th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-PReGdOEwHorDMQxf6BrllJCJgKd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b772ec24-c185-4326-9df3-4ee81719cec9&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FQHaqbVIDyojqPkx8WwDl9fmxgJh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;QHaqbVIDyojqPkx8WwDl9fmxgJh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:459059,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b772ec24-c185-4326-9df3-4ee81719cec9&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FQHaqbVIDyojqPkx8WwDl9fmxgJh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;QHaqbVIDyojqPkx8WwDl9fmxgJh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:459059,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5359\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5359\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5359\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a6757846-d0e0-43fc-9fb3-85067edc5209.png\" alt=\"T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm s\u1ea3n v\u00e0 xem x\u00e9t k\u1ef9 th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a6757846-d0e0-43fc-9fb3-85067edc5209.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a6757846-d0e0-43fc-9fb3-85067edc5209-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a6757846-d0e0-43fc-9fb3-85067edc5209-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a6757846-d0e0-43fc-9fb3-85067edc5209-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a6757846-d0e0-43fc-9fb3-85067edc5209-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5359\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm s\u1ea3n v\u00e0 xem x\u00e9t k\u1ef9 th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Ij9Ldbgyyo78IKxo9YrljDzbgeI\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqzudhH0YoctcCxXbmylvmH7gCb\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng thanh t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm \u1edf \u0111\u1ea7u trang \u0111\u1ec3 g\u00f5 t\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n mua. Amazon cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc r\u1ea5t chi ti\u1ebft \u1edf b\u00ean tr\u00e1i m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n thu h\u1eb9p k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm theo th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, m\u1ee9c gi\u00e1, \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u ti\u00eau ch\u00ed kh\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXs5dOAPDoEwidxc2wflqChpgpb\">Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh mua, h\u00e3y d\u00e0nh th\u1eddi gian \u0111\u1ec3:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DHsndeguYo6hvDxSoi9lDs32gMe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecdc k\u1ef9 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 v\u00e0 th\u00f4ng s\u1ed1 k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u00fang v\u1edbi nhu c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NIiQd52hKogQbIxS77Ilydslgkd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecdc \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 (reviews) c\u1ee7a nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua tr\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 ngu\u1ed3n th\u00f4ng tin v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng qu\u00fd gi\u00e1 \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 uy t\u00edn c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-MndKduQC6o9983xvYOVlQ1PAgNf\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 thanh to\u00e1n<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XGIFdxbz6oDKBcxGQVAlkfFAgXd\">Khi \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u01b0ng \u00fd, nh\u1ea5n n\u00fat &#8220;Add to Cart&#8221;. Sau khi ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ea1i gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng, b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh &#8220;Proceed to Checkout&#8221;. T\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\u1ea7n \u0111i\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c thanh to\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-YQWDdj2Vgoghl6x70RHlx6Cwg0c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;1036f755-9bce-4839-8993-8867368c8134&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVF2QbqjlooYY9oxPbYglKuUxgBg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;VF2QbqjlooYY9oxPbYglKuUxgBg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:191299,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;1036f755-9bce-4839-8993-8867368c8134&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVF2QbqjlooYY9oxPbYglKuUxgBg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;VF2QbqjlooYY9oxPbYglKuUxgBg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:191299,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5360\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5360\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5360\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/41246270-832b-40c0-ac73-b7733459b8de.png\" alt=\"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 thanh to\u00e1n\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/41246270-832b-40c0-ac73-b7733459b8de.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/41246270-832b-40c0-ac73-b7733459b8de-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/41246270-832b-40c0-ac73-b7733459b8de-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/41246270-832b-40c0-ac73-b7733459b8de-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/41246270-832b-40c0-ac73-b7733459b8de-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5360\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 thanh to\u00e1n<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Ij9Ldbgyyo78IKxo9YrljDzbgeI\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-SDxYdbgiyoufydxo1Nolx8n9gOg\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: V\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n v\u1ec1 Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-UwrOd0c7KoFd0GxrXvtl18pngZe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;aa5b22a4-4ff0-48aa-8c6a-82185e6c9009&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FBNxbbw3UhoNwcuxSkHhlnWEmgYc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;BNxbbw3UhoNwcuxSkHhlnWEmgYc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400605,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;aa5b22a4-4ff0-48aa-8c6a-82185e6c9009&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FBNxbbw3UhoNwcuxSkHhlnWEmgYc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;BNxbbw3UhoNwcuxSkHhlnWEmgYc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400605,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5361\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5361\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5361\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/69e2c9f5-d567-480a-839b-b0ced04ad0d3.png\" alt=\"V\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n v\u1ec1 Vi\u1ec7t Nam\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/69e2c9f5-d567-480a-839b-b0ced04ad0d3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/69e2c9f5-d567-480a-839b-b0ced04ad0d3-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/69e2c9f5-d567-480a-839b-b0ced04ad0d3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/69e2c9f5-d567-480a-839b-b0ced04ad0d3-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/69e2c9f5-d567-480a-839b-b0ced04ad0d3-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5361\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>V\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n v\u1ec1 Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Ij9Ldbgyyo78IKxo9YrljDzbgeI\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PGjudmJOQoj4TPxmcUxlPf6Ygwg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua h\u00e0ng t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam. C\u00f3 hai c\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Be6xdaD10oElQzxaKRslxTU8gmg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ship tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp (n\u1ebfu c\u00f3):<\/strong> M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u00edt s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Amazon h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n th\u1eb3ng v\u1ec1 Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZnoVda7J6oolSFxq44mlgWNogCD\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 mua h\u1ed9 v\u00e0 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a b\u00ean th\u1ee9 ba:<\/strong> \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn nh\u1ea5t. B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd cung c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 kho c\u1ee7a \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n n\u00e0y t\u1ea1i M\u1ef9, sau \u0111\u00f3 h\u1ecd s\u1ebd nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 l\u00e0m c\u00e1c th\u1ee7 t\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ec3 chuy\u1ec3n h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb M\u1ef9 v\u1ec1 Vi\u1ec7t Nam cho b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-LnItdFCaVoeg9jxLh7elCLzPgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1c c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p (FAQs)<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-UYLCdIDIOo3smVx1k3Cln7gogQZ\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Amazon c\u00f3 ship h\u00e0ng th\u1eb3ng v\u1ec1 Vi\u1ec7t Nam kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GOMSdlG9ioHWmOx0LlvlNCligIh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00f3, nh\u01b0ng ch\u1ec9 \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng cho m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 m\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, thu\u1ebf c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u00e1 cao. H\u1ea7u h\u1ebft ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n trung gian.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-QnPKdNGBfo1Dxzxqt0hlPjK6gSf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Thanh to\u00e1n tr\u00ean Amazon b\u1eb1ng th\u1ebb g\u00ec?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PTBndCsLeobLyfxEN9bldZ1Ogyh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i th\u1ebb thanh to\u00e1n qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn nh\u01b0 Visa, Mastercard, American Express.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GLeyd9EwxoTwDIxftGalsdgdged\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>L\u00e0m sao \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lumqd5vUdowiQOxjNtxlRX4ogWh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c &#8220;Your Orders&#8221;, t\u00ecm \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00f3 v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn &#8220;Cancel items&#8221;.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-F8ZLdAo0Wo4mfmxPfMilGrFPgLc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00f3 nh\u1eefng lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed n\u00e0o khi mua h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon v\u1ec1 Vi\u1ec7t Nam?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M1FNdREjQoe5nVxMOfVlBkJQg8g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ngo\u00e0i gi\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 th\u00eam ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n n\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ecba M\u1ef9 (n\u1ebfu c\u00f3), ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf, thu\u1ebf nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u v\u00e0 ph\u00ed d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 cho b\u00ean th\u1ee9 ba (n\u1ebfu s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng).<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0rvdKfG8olty1xXtlBlG2oJgIg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Qua b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y,<strong> Lemon Digital<\/strong> \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 b\u1ea1n th\u00f4ng tin chi ti\u1ebft cho c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi v\u1ec1 Amazon l\u00e0 g\u00ec? \u0110\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 cung c\u1ea5p th\u00eam th\u00f4ng tin chi ti\u1ebft h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh, l\u1ee3i \u00edch v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch mua h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amzon<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BJl3dODrWo3m54x1zR3lD2OXg0f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trang web mua s\u1eafm, m\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1nh c\u1eeda m\u1edf ra th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GwN3dnpzIoIsUZxYKN1lCBg9gUY\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1eb7c d\u00f9 quy tr\u00ecnh mua h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p h\u01a1n m\u1ed9t ch\u00fat so v\u1edbi c\u00e1c s\u00e0n n\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ecba, nh\u01b0ng v\u1edbi s\u1ef1 \u0111a d\u1ea1ng v\u1ec1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 uy t\u00edn, \u0111\u00e2y ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t k\u00eanh mua s\u1eafm \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n n\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ld8YdYVFuo51A9xhvPIltoMKgIe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u th\u00eam th\u00f4ng tin v\u1ec1 Amazon c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 c\u00e1c s\u00e0n TM\u0110T kh\u00e1c t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf, h\u00e3y xem th\u00eam c\u00e1c b\u00e0i blog \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb Lemon Digital<strong>.<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LaiBdSXzMo8fM6xoC1UlOJItgM3\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NVNDdxLbRo3Mfjx8Hbolwlo6gHd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QGJwdvU0joaI3rx0kjWlb1Ksglc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WOfrd1LryoA43Exbwf7ldn7sgpH\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RfKbdIzAZoBuJaxIMIWlDNXUgif\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KNpddvixBoLYyJx9TOlluUtWgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SRQ8dgWiLoU0dfx4QCslOJ1ugXo\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Amazon l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1i t\u00ean v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng quen thu\u1ed9c tr\u00ean to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u, nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i ai c\u0169ng hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 v\u1ec1 quy m\u00f4, l\u1ecbch s\u1eed v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a &#8220;g\u00e3 kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3&#8221; n\u00e0y. \u0110\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trang web mua s\u1eafm, m\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng t\u1eadp \u0111o\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed v\u00e0 [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5710,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[31,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5355","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-amazon","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5355","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\